3c72e21-cd78-4478-b8c5-a9ac652b512a","position":{"commit_sha":"3745860c3a1ede22e0a7d41de7dcc0ce0a7a9937","position":"1788046502895862761-83c72e21-cd78-4478-b8c5-a9ac652b512a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit change pushed for review: **[change 2392](https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2392)** — \"W3: raise verify-identity pack budget to 550 MiB\".\n\n- Commit: `d86b5481823f`, Change-Id `I1e51ca1f84f3e068128fb02c7fad19d94a0b6235`, trailer `rebar-ticket: a8ba-a2a3-e9c8-4ffa`, DCO signed-off.\n- Diff: `.github/workflows/verify-identity.yml` (`REBAR_CHECKOUT_PACK_LIMIT_KIB` 102400 → 563200 + self-documenting bridge comment naming restore ticket `fluorspar-comparable-zeren`), and the one workflow-coupled test expectation `test_pack_guard_contract` (102400 → 563200). Local `make lint` + the coupled unit test pass.\n- Status at push: `NEW`, `LLM-Review 0`, `Verified 0` (bot + CI votes pending). **Awaiting `LLM-Review +1` and `Verified +1`; not self-submitted** — the orchestrator/human submits.","timestamp":1788046323506492988}],"created_at":1788044611167368976,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"83c72e21-cd78-4478-b8c5-a9ac652b512a","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c244-26e8-7703-4cc8"}],"description":"## Context\n\nThe `Verify Authorship Identity` CI gate (`.github/workflows/verify-identity.yml`) fails closed\nwhen the blobless CI-checkout pack of the `tickets` branch exceeds\n`REBAR_CHECKOUT_PACK_LIMIT_KIB` (today `102400` = 100 MiB, a deliberate growth canary from commit\n`16a1a385` / ticket `037b`). The pack is currently ~481 MiB, so the gate is RED (bug\n`defensive-buckskin-rhino` / `a453-193b-2864-451b`).\n\nThe proof on parent epic `536b-8930-b922-4063` establishes that the ONLY lever that shrinks this\nblobless pack is reducing reachable commit+tree objects via causal-stability history collapse, and\nthat even maximal SAFE coalescing (N=30d horizon) lands at ~365-380 MiB — it cannot reach 100 MiB\nwithout an unsafe <4-day horizon. Therefore a temporary budget-raise bridge is unavoidable to get\nthe health lane green while the reclaim mechanism + structural fixes (W1 batch write lane, W2 root\ntree shard) land.\n\n## Scope of THIS ticket (the bridge, this change only)\n\nRaise `REBAR_CHECKOUT_PACK_LIMIT_KIB` from `102400` (100 MiB) to `563200` (550 MiB) — ~70 MiB\nheadroom over today's 481 MiB pack — and add a self-documenting comment immediately above the\nvalue that names the restore ticket (`fluorspar-comparable-zeren` / `0894-b9b8-6590-4904`) so the\nbridge is reversible and traceable. This is a temporary, deliberately-reversible loosening of the\ncanary, NOT a permanent budget change; the restore is tracked separately.\n\nOne companion test is coupled to the declared budget:\n`tests/unit/test_ci_tickets_partial_clone_workflows.py::test_pack_guard_contract` reads the live\nworkflow env and asserts it equals the parametrized value, so that expectation must move in\nlockstep (`102400` -> `563200`). The other `102400`/`_STANDALONE_LIMIT` occurrences in the test\nsuite are subprocess-env fixtures passed as explicit guard overrides (not read from the workflow),\nso they are unaffected and stay as-is.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nThe history-reclaim mechanism (S0-S3), W1/W2 structural fixes, and the eventual restore to 100 MiB\nare separate tickets under the epic. This ticket does no history rewrite and no prod mutation of\nthe `tickets` branch.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `REBAR_CHECKOUT_PACK_LIMIT_KIB` in `.github/workflows/verify-identity.yml` is set to `563200`.\n- [ ] A comment immediately above the value marks it as a TEMPORARY bridge and names restore ticket `fluorspar-comparable-zeren` (`0894-b9b8-6590-4904`).\n- [ ] The companion coupled expectation is updated: `test_pack_guard_contract` in `tests/unit/test_ci_tickets_partial_clone_workflows.py` moves its parametrized limit from `102400` to `563200` so it re-asserts the new declared budget.\n- [ ] The guard control flow is unchanged: only the threshold value, its self-documenting comment, and that one coupled test expectation change; the `git count-objects` fail-closed logic is untouched.\n- [ ] The commit carries a `rebar-ticket:` trailer for this ticket and a DCO sign-off.\n- [ ] The change is pushed to Gerrit for review (`LLM-Review +1` and `Verified +1`) and is NOT self-submitted.\n\n## Portability\n\n`REBAR_CHECKOUT_PACK_LIMIT_KIB` is a plain workflow environment variable consumed by a POSIX\n`bash`/`git count-objects` guard; changing its value introduces no dependence on any single CI\nprovider and no new capability. The `project.portability` criterion is satisfied because the guard\nremains a provider-agnostic shell check whose only input is a git object count.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":".github/workflows/verify-identity.yml","reason":"Raise REBAR_CHECKOUT_PACK_LIMIT_KIB from 102400 to 563200 and add a temporary-bridge comment naming restore ticket fluorspar-comparable-zeren (0894-b9b8-6590-4904)."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_ci_tickets_partial_clone_workflows.py","reason":"Update test_pack_guard_contract parametrized limit from 102400 to 563200 to match the new declared workflow budget (the only workflow-coupled test expectation)."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["parent","536b-8930-b922-4063"],["relates_to","c244-26e8-7703-4cc8"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"536b-8930-b922-4063","parent_status_uuid":"c402a335-8466-498b-b2c5-a3ed80f5bc07","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"a8ba-a2a3-e9c8-4ffa","ticket_type":"task","title":"W3 bridge: raise verify-identity pack budget to 550 MiB while 536b reclaim lands","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6d38fdb3-23ca-4391-b4d0-ed51ac712fcb","4ef7df1e-176e-407f-b9cc-0640ec173d44","5d91e512-1e9a-4d99-95e1-d94e79adf05a","271edfd3-17b6-4c65-86d0-c8b2b0fbcbc3","d528c8b0-6dd1-4042-9973-6adea73fbce8","c402a335-8466-498b-b2c5-a3ed80f5bc07","34d0efef-e321-4fdb-9499-cebcc9d378d8","993fb279-037b-4baf-ae4c-bf7ac1d1d70a","83c72e21-cd78-4478-b8c5-a9ac652b512a"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788049923866982058,"uuid":"9b741328-9486-4e0b-9070-3f57b23d6cf5"}